# Which knowledge files each skill carries.
#
# knowledge/ is the only place a human edits legal substance. This map declares
# which of those files get copied into each skill's references/ directory at
# build time, so a standalone .skill upload is self-contained on claude.ai,
# where a plugin root does not exist.
#
# Format: <skill-name> <knowledge-file>

niw-evaluate  current-adjudication-bar.md
niw-evaluate  policy-alerts.md
niw-evaluate  legal-framework.md
niw-evaluate  policy-manual-substance.md
niw-evaluate  verdict-rubric.md
niw-evaluate  archetype-calibration.md
niw-evaluate  endeavor-proposal.md
niw-evaluate  eb2-baseline.md
niw-evaluate  orientation.md
